        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    Note over Admin,PostgreSQL: CU-05 - Editar Usuario\n    participant Admin as Administrador (sysadmin)\n    participant Vue as Vue Frontend (Admin/Users/Form.vue)\n    participant Controller as UserController\n    participant PostgreSQL\n\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 1. Click &quot;Editar&quot; en fila\n    Vue-&gt;&gt;Controller: 2. GET /admin/users/{id}/edit\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 3. Cargar datos del usuario\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Vue: 4. Formulario precargado\n    Note over Controller,Vue: Password bloqueado por seguridad criptografica\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 5. Modificar campos\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 6. Click &quot;Guardar Cambios&quot;\n    Vue-&gt;&gt;Controller: 7. PUT /admin/users/{id}\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 8. Validar unicidad coord. por area\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 9. UPDATE users + sinc. rol\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Vue: 10. Redirect 302 /admin/users\n    Vue--&gt;&gt;Admin: 11. Tabla actualizada&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="cu05-seq">
